It is Thursday afternoon, and I am at the office.
My colleague Prakash and I are drinking tea.
He asks me about the evening.
"Maya, are you going to the gym today?" Prakash asks.
"No," I reply.
"From now on, I am going to play badminton on Thursdays."
"I will go to the gym only on Tuesdays."
"At what time are you going to play?" Prakash asks.
"At half past five in the evening, as usual," I say.
"I like to play this game very much in my home country of Mexico," I explain.
"Can you play well?" Prakash asks.
"Yes, I can play well," I say smiling.
"I also like to meet new people."
"That is very good," Prakash says.
We finish drinking tea.
After that, we go to work again.
